.TH "AG\-CLI\-REPO\-PUSH\-RULE\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-repo\-push\-rule\-edit \- Edit repository push rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli repo push\-rule edit [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit repository\-wide push rules.
.PP
\&Only flags explicitly provided are sent to AtomGit; omitted settings remain
\&unchanged. Explicit false, empty\-string, and zero values are preserved. All
\&updates require confirmation unless \-\-yes is supplied.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-commit\-message\-regex <string>\fR
\&Regular expression required for commit messages (empty disables it)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-deny\-force\-push\fR
\&Deny force pushes, including from administrators
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output the updated fields as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-file\-size <int>\fR
\&Maximum committed file size in MB (0 disables the limit)
\&Default: \(dq0\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-reject\-not\-signed\-by\-gpg\fR
\&Require commits to have verified GPG signatures
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-rule\-for\-owner\fR
\&Exempt repository administrators from applicable push rules
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
\&Skip update confirmation
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli repo push\-rule edit owner/repo \-\-deny\-force\-push \-\-yes
\&  ag\-cli repo push\-rule edit \-\-commit\-message\-regex '^(feat|fix): '
\&  ag\-cli repo push\-rule edit owner/repo \-\-reject\-not\-signed\-by\-gpg=false \-\-max\-file\-size 0
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBag\-cli\-repo\-push\-rule\fR(1)
